/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回衣装チェンジが物凄く沢山あって、\n早着替えだらけで、一曲の半分踊ったら半分着替えてすぐ出る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで、リハーサルは、ちょーギリギリで、リボンがつけれなかったり、スカート違うのを履いたりで、大変でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本番では出来たのでよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち位置もいつもと違って、沢山移動があったりも覚えるのも大変だったけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆のおかげで本当に素敵なライブになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいた方も居たのですが、\n本番、水玉模様を踊ってる時、\n傘を持ってパフォーマンスしたのですが、衣装に傘の骨が引っ掛かって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傘折れたんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃくちゃ恥ずかしかったんですけどそのまま踊りました(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もう１つ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんに顔に紙吹雪みたいなのをペタペタはられて楽しく遊んでたんだけど...実は今から言うのはまいやんも知らないんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっそりまいやんの後ろ髪に紙吹雪を付けたの〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、そのまま挨拶にまいやんは行ってしまったから、紙を着けたままだったんだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんは知らないから、これを読んでたらばれちゃう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんは美人だし、本当に素敵なお姉ちゃまだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又誰かにイタズラしちゃおうかなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブのMCでも、あったように、私背が延びたそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/25/9653793/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスの先生に、ライブ終わり、ハイタッチしたときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『確かに大きくなったね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-cr